        "name": "Hatibagan NabinPally Durga Puja",
        "description": "Hatibagan Nabin Pally celebrates its 92nd year with this powerful theme, placing women freedom fighters from India’s independence movement at the heart of the pandal design.  ￼ The pandal transforms Goddess Durga into a symbol of feminine strength and sacrifice, honouring lesser-known heroines like Matangini Hazra, Kumudini Daku, and others.  ￼ With artist Avijit Ghatak’s direction, it’s a work of art that combines history, devotion, and social memory—making the visit both moving and inspiring.",
